# Protactinium · Pa · gate 91

**Protactinium** (Pa) is element **91** of the periodic table — a **actinide**, period 7, group f-block, f-block, solid at standard conditions, atomic weight **231.04**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
Rare, toxic, intensely radioactive; little beyond the research bench.

